# platform.rp2350_touch_lcd_154.rtc

An uptime-based software clock for the RP2350 1.54-inch LCD boards, which have
no battery-backed RTC. It starts unset and uses mm.mcu ticks after a time is
written. The date and time are lost on reset or power loss. Clockal can set it
over USB with tdset.
